; Import definitions for the Win32 APIs WinCLI implements.
; Used by guests/build.sh to generate kernel32.lib via rust-lld.
; Imported functions must have native trampolines in src/native.rs.
LIBRARY KERNEL32
EXPORTS
GetStdHandle
WriteFile
ExitProcess
CreateFileW
ReadFile
CreateIoCompletionPort
GetQueuedCompletionStatus
GetQueuedCompletionStatusEx
GetOverlappedResult
CloseHandle
CreateDirectoryW
RemoveDirectoryW
DeleteFileW
MoveFileW
CopyFileW
GetCommandLineW
GetCommandLineA
GetConsoleMode
SetConsoleMode
WriteConsoleW
GetConsoleOutputCP
SetConsoleTextAttribute
ReadConsoleW
GetLastError
SetLastError
GetProcessHeap
HeapAlloc
HeapFree
HeapReAlloc
HeapSize
VirtualAlloc
VirtualFree
VirtualProtect
GetEnvironmentStringsW
FreeEnvironmentStringsW
GetEnvironmentVariableW
SetEnvironmentVariableW
GetStartupInfoW
GetModuleHandleW
GetModuleHandleA
GetModuleHandleExW
GetModuleFileNameW
GetSystemInfo
GetSystemTimeAsFileTime
QueryPerformanceCounter
QueryPerformanceFrequency
GetCurrentProcess
GetCurrentThread
GetCurrentProcessId
GetCurrentThreadId
GetFileType
GetCurrentDirectoryW
GetFullPathNameW
GetFileAttributesW
MultiByteToWideChar
WideCharToMultiByte
GetACP
GetOEMCP
IsValidCodePage
IsDebuggerPresent
IsProcessorFeaturePresent
lstrlenW
EncodePointer
Sleep
SleepEx
SwitchToThread
TerminateProcess
FlsAlloc
FlsFree
FlsGetValue
FlsSetValue
InitializeCriticalSectionEx
EnterCriticalSection
LeaveCriticalSection
DeleteCriticalSection
InitializeSListHead
